            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mirba Estrellas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I prefer adding chunks of plaintain, not chayote. Adds another dimension to the broth. Also like napa cabbage or bokeh choy. If you cook the beef long enough, bouillon is not necessary. Soup bones are ideal.",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-16T12:38:38.147Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
