            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GourmetGale"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added garlic salt and seasoned salt after it was cooked. It made the dish much tastier. If you don't \"doctor\" it a bit, it is incredibly bland. That being said, the fresh veggies were wonderful. Meat was just so-so.",
